PHASE 1: IDEATION PHASE

Project Title: FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator Using Gemini Models

1. Introduction

FitBuddy is an AI-based fitness plan generator designed to help users obtain personalized fitness suggestions using Gemini AI.

2. Problem Statement

People may find it difficult to identify fitness activities and plans that suit their individual needs.

3. Proposed Solution

FitBuddy aims to generate personalized fitness plans based on user inputs using Gemini AI.

4. Objectives

- To develop an AI-based fitness plan generator.
- To provide personalized fitness suggestions.
- To create a simple and user-friendly application.
- To explore the use of Gemini AI in fitness planning.

5. Technologies Used

- Python
- Gemini AI
- JavaScript
- Other libraries and tools used in the actual project.

6. Expected Outcome

A working application that generates fitness plan suggestions based on user inputs.

7. Conclusion

FitBuddy demonstrates how generative AI can be used to support personalized fitness planning.
